* medusa
** Goal
*** Validate invariants, not crashes
*** Function-level properties
*** System-level properties
*** Stateful and stateless campaigns
** Architecture
*** cmd (Cobra CLI)
*** fuzzing (workers, corpus, coverage)
*** chain (TestChain on medusa-geth)
*** compilation (crytic-compile / solc)
*** events and hooks (Go API)
** Fuzzing lifecycle
*** Deploy targetContracts
*** Generate call sequence
*** Execute on TestChain
*** Update coverage maps
*** Store coverage-increasing sequences
*** Reset to base block
** Coverage guidance
*** Edge markers (source PC, dest PC)
*** Recorded on jumps, returns, reverts, entrance
*** New random sequence (p = 0.3)
*** Corpus mutation strategies
**** Corpus head / tail
**** Splice / interleave
*** Slither constant mining
*** Periodic corpus pruning
** Test providers
*** Assertion: EVM panic codes
*** Property: property_ returns bool
*** Optimization: optimize_ returns int256
*** Shrinking to minimal sequence
** Using it on a project
*** medusa init
*** targetContracts and testLimit
*** Wrapper functions with clamping
*** corpusDirectory for reuse
*** HTML / LCOV coverage reports
*** Revert report for harness debugging
** Advanced features
*** Cheatcodes at 0x7109...DD12D
*** Fork mode over RPC
*** Genesis state from anvil dump
*** Predeployed contracts
*** console.log support
@endmindmap
